# Purpose: Sort ISO-timestamped deployment records into chronological order for a release audit.
# Inputs: deploy/events.psv: headerless pipe-separated deployment records whose first column is an ISO-8601 UTC timestamp.
# Outputs: reports/deployment-timeline.psv: deployment records sorted chronologically; stdout echoes the timeline.
accept events_path as text with default "deploy/events.psv"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["reports"]
run cat with path events_path
pipe to sort
then save to "reports/deployment-timeline.psv"
